                                                "sense_id": "f4700c18-8e22-35c7-b51a-d28c18a84534",
                                                "text": "In this chapter two types of signature schemes satisfying homomorphic properties are presented. In the first section a description of the homomorphic signature schemes suitable in the single-user scenario is provided."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed91feef-f8c5-49f9-bc70-c43d70f6637a",
                                                "sense_id": "f4700c18-8e22-35c7-b51a-d28c18a84534",
                                                "text": "Fully homomorphic encryption (FHE) is a new encryption technique that enables computing on data blindly, without decrypting it."
